  - type: 0
    text: A newly recruited Paladin joins our Assassin at Step 0, frozen in time by the Heavenly Eye. Command both warriors as one, Varek!
    tutorialTargetId: OwnedReadyBar
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Select your Paladin on the Ready Bar to lead the assault.
    tutorialTargetId: Unit2
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 3
    text: March the Paladin to (0, 1) to corner the ambusher in a diagonal crossfire within axe range.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 1}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm the Paladin's advance.
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 2.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Movement is an Instant action, so time remains frozen for his attack. Select the Paladin again.
    tutorialTargetId: Unit2
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 6
    text: Left-click his Weapon Skill (Axe Swing) to ready a heavy cleave.
    tutorialTargetId: WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 3
    text: Lock onto the ambusher at (1, 0) now trapped inside our kill zone.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 1, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm the strike command.
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 1.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: Notice how your command is locked in, yet the axe has not fallen? Use the Heavenly Eye to inspect why.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 7
    text: Left-click the Paladin on the board at (0, 1) to view his combat readout.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 1}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 2
    text: Right-click his Weapon Skill to inspect its execution timing.
    tutorialTargetId: WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: "Look at the Skill Type: every weapon attack is Non-Instant (Delayed)."
    tutorialTargetId: STYPE
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 0
    text: While time is frozen, Non-Instant strikes queue up and unleash together once the Instant closes, ordered by unit Speed.
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
    slideId: 
    slideSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - type: 1
